Package: ksrp-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: curl, wget, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0
Recommends: python3 (>= 3.8), nodejs (>= 16), xdg-utils
Suggests: libqt6widgets6t64 | libqt6widgets6
Installed-Size: 5120
Maintainer: KSRP Team <dev@ksrp.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/devdreiortiz/KSPR-DESKTOP
Description: KSPR Desktop - AI Code Analysis Assistant
 KSPR Desktop is a graphical interface for the KSPR CLI,
 an AI-powered code analysis assistant.
 .
 Features include:
 - AI Chat with KSPR I assistant
 - File management and code ingestion
 - Real-time metrics dashboard
 - Glassmorphism UI design
 - Native Qt6 desktop application
 - Web-based interface fallback
 .
 After installation, run 'kspr-desktop' to start the application.
 The first run will automatically download and configure all components.
